      <description><![CDATA[
<h3>Fixed</h3>
<ul>
<li><strong>Saving a profile no longer drops a display in silence.</strong> The save form reads the displays attached at the moment you press Save, so a monitor unplugged while the form was open simply never made it into the profile — you picked three displays and got two, with nothing said. It now tells you, and <code>viberes</code> reports it too.</li>
</ul>
      ]]></description>
